            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>Version 2.0.0</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed horizontal scroll beep — events now match real Magic Trackpad format</li>
                    <li>Pinch zoom works in all web maps (Safari, Chrome, Baidu Maps, Google Maps)</li>
                    <li>4-finger swipe fires reliably on displacement threshold</li>
                    <li>Two-finger rotation gesture support (Photos, Preview)</li>
                    <li>Scroll momentum continues during modal UI (menus/dialogs)</li>
                    <li>Tablet mode: natural scroll enforced, cursor hidden during gestures</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
